      "text": "**§ 2. Street Vending Coordinators.** The Police Commissioner and the Commissioner of Business Services shall be the City's Street Vending Coordinators. The Police Commissioner or his or her designee shall be responsible for developing and implementing coordinated City-wide strategies to enforce the laws and rules regulating street vending. The Commissioner of Business Services or his or her designee shall be responsible for developing and implementing enhanced services for vendors.",
