      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**§ 3. Street Vendor Operating Committee.** There is hereby established a Street Vendor Operating Committee to advise the Street Vending Coordinators with regard to the formulation, implementation and evaluation of street vendor policy and program initiatives. The co-chairs of the Operating Committee shall be the Police Commissioner or his or her designee and the Commissioner of Business Services or his or her designee. The other members of the Operating Committee shall be the Commissioner of Consumer Affairs or his or her designee, the Commissioner of Health or his or her designee, the Executive Director of the Economic Policy and Marketing Group or his or her designee, the Director of the Mayor's Office of City Legislative Affairs or his or her designee, and the Director of the Community Assistance Unit or his or her designee. All city agencies shall be required",
